{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-ii", "title": "公孫丑下", "description": "孟子曰：「天時不如地利，地利不如人和。三里之城，七里之郭，環而攻之而不勝。夫環而攻之，必有得天時者矣；然而不勝者，是天時不如地利也。城非不高也，池非不深也，兵革非不堅利也，米粟非不多也；委而去之，是地利不如人和也。故曰：域民不以封疆之界，固國不以山谿之險，威天下不以兵革之利。得道者多助，失道者寡助。寡助之至，親戚畔之；", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "公", "id": "公"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "昔", "id": "昔"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "為", "id": "爲"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "畔", "id": "畔"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "美", "id": "美"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "過", "id": "過"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.2205021062771466, "source": "過", "target": "公"}, {"weight": 0.26784373023211666, "source": "使", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 0.43036265972989163, "source": "使", "target": "爲"}, {"weight": 1.0663514264498881, "source": "使", "target": "公"}, {"weight": 1.8772816426662169, "source": "使", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.1841344621062717, "source": "使", "target": "畔"}, {"weight": 0.5845133395571499, "source": "知", "target": "爲"}, {"weight": 0.016529301951210506, "source": "知", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.2205021062771466, "source": "知", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 1.2205021062771466, "source": "知", "target": "公"}, {"weight": 2.031432322493475, "source": "知", "target": "畔"}, {"weight": 0.8721954120089308, "source": "臣", "target": "爲"}, {"weight": 1.7594986070098335, "source": "臣", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 0.8150369981689821, "source": "臣", "target": "公"}, {"weight": 0.8919980393051105, "source": "仁", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 3.6000482404073204, "source": "仁", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.21375387928743, "source": "仁", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.4599820769110496, "source": "仁", "target": "爲"}, {"weight": 2.9069010598473755, "sourc